{"user": "Can you identify the best move in this Othello endgame and the key line against best play? Please focus on which of g2, b6, a7, b7, b8, c8 wins most discs.", "user_ts": "2026-08-04T23:55:52.493611+00:00", "assistant": "Best move for Black: **b7**.\n\nKey point: **b7 flips the whole 7th row (c7\u2013g7)** and, more importantly, keeps Black\u2019s mobility/endgame control. The tempting alternatives like **b8/c8/a7** tend to give White better access to the lower-left corner/edge fight, and **g2** doesn\u2019t solve that.\n\nA critical best-play line starts:\n\n**1. b7 a3 2. g2**\n\nThen if White continues with **b6**, Black must be careful: the key idea is to use **a7/c8** to control the diagonal toward **h1**, because if **c6 stays White**, White can often get **h1** later via the diagonal **h1\u2013g2\u2013f3\u2013e4\u2013d5\u2013c6**.\n\nSo, among **g2, b6, a7, b7, b8, c8**, the move that wins Black the most discs is:\n\n**b7**.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-04T23:55:52.493611+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-04T23:55:57.493611+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "votes": {"Common Ground Question": 2, "Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Common Ground Question": 0.6666666666666666, "Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "llama": ["Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Move Verdict", "Board Report", "Local Justification", "Worked Line"], "consensus": ["Move Verdict", "Board Report", "Local Justification", "Worked Line"], "votes": {"Move Verdict": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "Worked Line": 3, "Board Report": 2, "General Principle": 1}, "confidence": {"Move Verdict": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "Worked Li